  "modules": [
    {
      "dotted": "no_alloc_ok",
      "path": "no_alloc_ok.pr",
      "source": "-- `@ noalloc` is `fbip` spelled as a usage fact on the result: the function\n-- and its whole call tree must allocate no fresh heap cell. `inc` only does\n-- arithmetic and `twice` calls only `inc`, so both certify; `main` stays pure.\nfn inc(x : Int) : Int @ noalloc = x + 1\n\nfn twice(x : Int) : Int @ noalloc = inc(inc(x))\n\nfn main() : Int = twice(40)\n"
    }
  ],
